{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35715","headline":"塘上行 · 李咸用","name":"塘上行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"横塘日澹秋云隔，浪织轻颸罗幂幂。\n红绡撇水荡舟人，画桡掺掺柔荑白。\n鲤鱼虚掷无消息，花老莲疎愁未摘。\n却把金钗打绿荷，懊恼露珠穿不得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}